      "customfield_10012" : "0|i002sv:",
      "customfield_10300" : "{}",
      "description" : {
         "content" : [
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "text" : "not sure where this goes.",
                     "type" : "text"
                  }
               ],
               "type" : "paragraph"
            },
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "text" : "But my oringal idea was for WebService stuff (like II-Ingest-Gateway):",
                     "type" : "text"
                  }
               ],
               "type" : "paragraph"
            },
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "text" : "Want table :",
                     "type" : "text"
                  },
                  {
                     "type" : "hardBreak"
                  },
                  {
                     "text" : "HostRelURL              Last 5Min                Last Hr                           Total",
                     "type" : "text"
                  },
                  {
                     "type" : "hardBreak"
                  },
                  {
                     "text" : "/get-this-or-that        4 calls; 2.4ms ave   64 calls; 33.4ms ave       ....",
                     "type" : "text"
                  },
                  {
                     "type" : "hardBreak"
                  },
                  {
                     "text" : "....",
                     "type" : "text"
                  },
                  {
                     "type" : "hardBreak"
                  },
                  {
                     "text" : "TOTAL-------------\r",
                     "type" : "text"
                  }
               ],
               "type" : "paragraph"
            },
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "text" : "And input to this:",
                     "type" : "text"
                  },
                  {
                     "type" : "hardBreak"
                  },
                  {
                     "text" : "NoteCall(URL/LABEL, duration)",
                     "type" : "text"
                  }
               ],
               "type" : "paragraph"
            },
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "text" : "CTOR for collector says bucket intervals. always provide (cheap) total. Expensive if buckets.",
                     "type" : "text"
                  }
               ],
               "type" : "paragraph"
            },
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "text" : "Cuz for each category, we must track timestamps (and durations/cnts) for every time in largest bucket).",
                     "type" : "text"
                  }
               ],
               "type" : "paragraph"
            },
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "text" : "So from WS apps - we must provide config setting saying if we just keep totals (cehap) or also keep incremntal values.",
                     "type" : "text"
                  }
               ],
               "type" : "paragraph"
            }
         ],
         "type" : "doc",
         "version" : 1
      },
